(a) Permit required. The owner or operator (hereinafter called "the user") of a food processing establishment, food sales establishment, or food service establishment which discharges wastewater into the city's sewer system, installed before the adoption of the ordinance from which this article is derived, shall obtain a food service wastewater discharge permit. Failure to obtain the food service wastewater discharge permit shall be grounds for water service interruption.
